msgid "valdivitiantites!yo yo! It’s yuor boi Davd Mosttttt!!! comin 2 u LIVE from the BEST virgin mojito bar EVER. like for real this stuf is legit SO GOODD. ive had like twelf and i feel amazingggggg. Cant believ theirs not even any alcohol!! jH19!"
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_5/11
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "hey did u guys see how dope that presention was?! we ROCKED THAT!!! like ppl keep sayin we’re in \"dire financial straips\" and need \"urgent restructring.\" even my dad was like \"ur gonna get smoked by ur top competitor ByteWave.\" deadass."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_5/16
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "and imlike \"ok dad. if you like Bytewave so much why dont you marryyyy them.\" but does biteWIPE have a contract with the US GOVERNMENT?!? NoooOOoOOOoooooO"
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_5/21
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "i just wanna say i love u guys. but NOT FRANKLIN. idont love or miss franklin AT ALL. YOU HEAR ME FRANKLIN?!"
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_5/26
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "night night nerdsssssss."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_6/11
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Salutations and a good greeting from your CEO, David Most!"
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_6/16
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Wow, the other night was quite a lively celebration wasn’t it? Honestly I don’t remember much, which means Sandy in Corporate Events Planning did her usual bang up job. Inspirational work Sandy, way to earn that 3% cost of living bonus. Keep it up and undoubtedly you’ll be CEO one day!"
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_6/21
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Unfortunately sometime during the festivities, my sunglasses seem to have been misplaced. By who exactly is impossible to know for sure. We combed every inch of the hotel — and they did not end up in the lost and found — so it seems likely someone mistakenly took them home."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_6/26
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Honestly they’re worthless — but they were given to me by someone special — and they do have some amount of sentimental value. So if you have any information related to their whereabouts, please email me ASAP."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_6/31
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Oh and if someone from the press happens to reach out: they were definitely just normal sunglasses and not a highly classified prototype we’re secretly developing in conjunction with the federal government."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_6/36
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Unrelated, please bid a fond Valdivian farewell to Sandy in Corporate Events Planning, whose role has been eliminated due to ongoing workforce optimization efforts. Best of luck in all your new endeavors, Sandy!"
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_7/11
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Guess who? If you guessed David Most, 3x runner-up for Business Magazine’s CEO of the Year, you’d be right!"
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_7/16
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Team, I just wanted to do a soft follow-up on my recent email regarding my lost sunglasses. I’m happy to report, my office has already received hundreds of tips regarding the item’s whereabouts and are quickly combing through them as we speak."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_7/21
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "However, I really must reiterate that the tip line is for verifiable leads only. \"I saw them in Turkmenistan,\" or \"Did you check up your butt?\" — while obviously <i>very</i> humorous — detracts from our serious efforts to expediently locate the missing item."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_7/26
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "In that spirit of camaraderie, anyone who sends a false lead will be downsized on sight. Thank you for your ongoing support in this matter."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_8/11
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "It’s David Most, your beloved CEO, with an important question. What do the following items have in common: cellophane, eye glasses, and bottled water? If you guessed, \"they’re all 15% off today only on Valdivian.com\" you’d be absolutely correct."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_8/16
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "But even more importantly: they’re all transparent. As your leader, I value transparency above all else. Especially when the Board of Directors changes the locks on my office (message received, Ian!)."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_8/21
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "With that spirit in mind, I need to share some difficult news with you today."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_8/26
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "I have not been entirely candid regarding my lost sunglasses. Firstly, the lost item was thankfully not my sunglasses."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_8/31
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "My sunglasses were handcrafted in Italy by blind artisans — are inlaid with conflict diamonds — and are locked in my safety deposit box."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_8/36
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "No, the missing item in question is actually a Valdivian prototype. And even more importantly, it’s the only existing prototype of the amazing, new gadget we’re planning to launch for the Q4 Blissmas Season. Unfortunately, the engineer who invented the prototype was a disgruntled former employee who destroyed the schematics before disappearing himself."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_8/41
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "So as you can see, it is imperative that the glasses are found as quickly as possible."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_8/46
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "To that end — and after discussing it with the Board — we are now prepared to offer a handsome reward for their expedient return: a $50 dollar gift card to Valdivian.com!"
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_9/6
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "ATTN Jackasses: It’s been weeks already and you’re seriously telling me there’s been absolutely no movement on this missing glasses issue?"
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_9/11
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Maybe I haven’t made myself crystal clear: nothing else matters. You get me? Your expense reports — corporate retreats — powerpoint presentations — I don’t care about any of it."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_9/16
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "This is your one and only priority."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_9/21
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "You find me those glasses if you gotta burn this whole worthless rat trap down to the foundation. And do it NOW."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_9/26
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Secretary Dawson at the Pentagon is breathing down my neck, and his breath stinks like flaming garbage."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_9/31
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "You think shareholders are bad to piss off? You do not want to screw the US Department of Overseas Violence, get me?!"
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_9/36
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "We’re all gonna end up buried alive in some desert somewhere. Find me those glasses NOW."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_9/41
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "And who the hell came up with the \"15% off transparent items\" promo? No consumer buys anything based off of how transparent it is. Find me whoever came up with that crap and fire them."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_9/46
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "-David"
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_10/11
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "CEO David Most coming at you from the Penthouse relaxation grotto, starting the day with endless gratitude for our Valdivian family and the incredible work you all do! Let's make today amazing!"
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_10/16
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Superstars, before today’s upcoming all-hands meeting, I just wanted to address the elephant in the relaxation grotto."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_10/21
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Recently, some 10,000 of you may have received a strange email not intended for you. This correspondence has understandably raised a lot of concerns, but let me assure you those concerns are misguided and unnecessary."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_10/26
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "The truth is, my email was hacked by a sophisticated internet hacker. We have yet to determine the exact culprit, but all signs point to a disgruntled former employee. Most likely Sandy from Corporate Events Planning; she was a worthless loser and no one liked her."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_10/31/b/1
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "In addition, Franklin, if you are listening, no one likes you either. Not me, not Val 9000, and any ploys that you were planning have been decidedly un-ployed for good."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_10/34
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "I’m sure we’ll discuss more during today’s meeting, but the top-line is: Valdivian is absolutely not in danger of running afoul of the federal government."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_10/39
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Additionally, for her negligence that allowed this breach, our Chief Security Officer Valerie Hernandez has been terminated effective immediately. We appreciate all her valued contributions to the Valdivian family, and wish her great success in all her future endeavors. ¡Mucho éxito, Valerie!"
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_10/44
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Looking forward to a lively exchange of ideas!"
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_11/11
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "It’s me. David Most. And today, just call me your Chief Endearing Officer."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_11/16
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "I realized that with all of the focus on finding my missing glasses (which are still missing), I haven’t been putting enough focus on you: our beloved employees. Well today that changes!"
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_11/21
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "To show each and every one of you just how integral you are to our annual net earnings, I’ve decided to send you all 1.4 ounces of chocolate-inspired munchables!"
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_11/26
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Yummers!"
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_11/31
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Your chocolate will be delivered shortly by Valdivian drone to your place of residence."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_11/36
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Oh! And if the drone starts to surveil your residence like it’s searching for something — like oh let’s say \"glasses\" for instance — do not be alarmed! That’s totally normal drone activity that all chocolate delivery drones definitely do."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_11/44
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Say that three times fast, haha! But in all seriousness don’t, as that would waste valuable company time."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_12/11
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "\"I’m CEO David Most and I approve this message,\" is what I’d be saying if my recent campaign for Governor had gotten any traction."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_12/16
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "But if it’s that important to the people of Wisconsin that I actually \"live there,\" that’s their prerogative."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_12/21
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Speaking of looking a gift-horse in the mouth, I’ve noticed almost no one has taken me up on my free chocolate offer."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_12/26
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Is it because to receive the chocolate you must agree to terms and conditions allowing Valdivian drones unrestricted access to search your property and/or boat house? Because my legal team assures me that’s in the Constitution."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_12/31
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Regardless, don’t wait too long: your free chocolate-adjacent cocoa-product only has a shelf life of 36 years!"
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_13/11
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Happy Valdivian Day from your master of ceremonies (and CEO) David Most! Today we celebrate the rich and vibrant history of the world’s first quadrillion dollar company."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_13/16
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Hard to believe we started only three years ago as a tiny, trillion dollar hedge fund with a dream."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_13/21
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Time flies."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_13/26
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "In celebration, I want to hear from you: what is your favorite part about working for Valdivian?"
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_13/31
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "My favorite part is how forgiveness plays such an integral role in our company culture. From that silly software glitch that caused our phones to spontaneously catch fire — to our nuclear server meltdown that threatened the Atlantic seaboard (I’m looking at you, Erwin!) — we’ve always valued forgiveness."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_13/36
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Speaking of forgiveness, there’s something else I’d like to discuss."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_13/41
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Those missing glasses? Well, apparently they were financed by — and are therefore partial property of — the US Department of Overseas Violence. And it’s very silly, but if we don’t find them soon I’ve been informed by our legal department there’s a high probability I’ll be charged with \"theft of federal property\" and possibly \"treason.\""
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_13/46
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "We are running out of time to find the glasses, so maybe work that into your Valdivian Day prayers and wishes?"
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_14/11
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Skylar Specs here with a very special announcement."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_14/16
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Just kidding! It’s your CEO, David Most."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_14/21
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Sorry for joshing you all with that little fib. I just thought a little levity would be a welcome respite from all the unwelcome tension around here."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_14/26
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "What with the constant firings — and the increasing threats from the federal government — it feels like we’ve all been a little on edge lately. In fact, I think we could all use a much-needed break."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_14/31
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "To that end, I’m inviting you all to this quarter’s Valdivian Team Building Retreat in beautiful Augusta, Missouri: America’s First Wine Region!"
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_14/36
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Come sip on blackberry wine (the first 15 ounces are on us!) — ride the wine trolley (it’s free) — and luxuriate in the limited, complimentary facilities (TBD)."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_14/41
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "All you have to do is show up! Oh and bring one top-secret prototype to share with the group (this’ll serve as your proof of admittance)."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_14/46
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "It can be something you built yourself — or something you maybe found lying around in a convention hall — it’s totally up to you!"
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_14/51
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "I’m so excited to relax with you and see all your amazing prototypes!"
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_15/11
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Sup it’s Dave. I’m here in Augusta, Missouri on the wine trolley. Drinking. By myself. Again."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_15/16
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Really can’t believe none of y’all showed up. Not even the people I thought liked me (looking at you, Brad). Real lame. I thought you guys were my friends. I thought we were a family."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_15/21
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "But guess I was wrong. First Franklin ditches me and now everyone else. And the worst part is he was right. About everything."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_15/26
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "He was right that we’d regret partnering with the feds. He was right that I’d drive the company into the dirt. He was right that I’d miss him."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_15/31
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Thinks he’s so perfect. What an ass."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_15/36
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Oh and by the way, effective immediately I’m canning our Team Development Facilitator. Can’t even put on a dumb corporate retreat successfully."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_15/41
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "I dunno even know what his name is. Harry? Larry? Anyway you know who you are, pack your junk and get the hell out. And screw it: Brad you’re fired too."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_15/46/b/1
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "You can direct any complaints to our new, improved, ultra-rude Val 9000."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_15/49
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Most out."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_16/11
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Greetings from the Opulence Recovery Center in sunny Malibu, California!"
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_16/16
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "\"My name is CEO David Most, and I have a problem.\" Haha, just a little treatment center humor for you."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_16/21
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "But in all seriousness, I will be working out of the recovery center for the next few weeks."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_16/26
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "The Board said it was either this or they’d \"burn me to a crisp and flush the ashes.\""
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_16/31
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "And I said, \"guys I may be gay, but I’d rather not be flaming.\" Haha, get it? The physicians say humor is the best medicine (aside from naltrexone)."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_16/36
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "But my road to recovery isn’t the only great news today! I’m also excited to announce that the US Department of Overseas Violence has agreed to work in tandem with Valdivian — giving us access to their proprietary surveillance technology — in order to finally apprehend the glasses thief."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_16/41
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "They said we were \"woefully incompetent\" and it was becoming apparent \"we’d screw this whole thing up royally without their help.\""
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_16/46
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "To aid in that effort, we will be requiring the following from all Valdivian employees by EOD: your name, your address, your social security number, your credit history, your blood type, your relationship history, a urine sample, a retinal scan, all your biometric and genetic data, access to your search history, all your internet passwords, and your favorite CEO in the world."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_16/54
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "The last one’s just for fun :)"
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_17/11
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "CEO David Most quickly checking in before checking out."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_17/16
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "That’s right team, I’ve finally finished my mandatory recovery program! They said they’d never seen someone more sober in their entire lives, so chalk up one more thing I’m the \"most\" of."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_17/21
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Get it? Because of my name, CEO David Most."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_17/26
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "And it looks like I’m arriving back not a moment too soon."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_17/31
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "As I understand it, there has been some employee push-back regarding our recent surveillance initiative? I’ve heard feedback calling it \"horrifically invasive,\" and \"definitely illegal.\""
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_17/36
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "I just want to all know that your privacy is our utmost priority, and our legal team assures me you can’t press charges. So you should rest easy."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_17/41
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Sure some of this may be unorthodox, but it’s nothing that I wouldn’t voluntarily share myself."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_17/46
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "For instance, regarding the \"relationship history\" question: you may be surprised to know that I’ve only ever had one relationship. His name was Franklin, and we were deeply in love."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_17/51
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "But he betrayed me, broke my heart, and what happened after that is none of your or the government’s business."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_17/56
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "See? If I can do it, you can do it! So don’t be shy: grab those plastic cups and get us those urine samples ASAP!"
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_18/11
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Have you ever been to outer space?"
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_18/16
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Well as of right now, I have!"
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_18/21
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Which means I, CEO David Most, have the distinction of being the first corporate CEO to send a team email from beyond our planet’s exosphere. Super exciting stuff."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_18/26
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "But you know what’s even more exciting? The pentagon has just sent over the final results of our initial employee audit."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_18/31
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "You’ll be happy to know that most of you passed with flying colors. And while unfortunately we have yet to determine who stole the lost glasses, the audit did pinpoint a number of employees the government would like to speak with..."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_18/36
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Thomas Hallmark: you owe $5,000 in back taxes."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_18/41
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Tiana Jackson: you’re pregnant with twins."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_18/46
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Ryan Crandon: the Department of Homeland Security will be outside your apartment in ten minutes."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_18/51
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "And Andre Garcia: you’ve been legally deceased since 1994."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_18/56
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Most importantly, this audit has led to a startling discovery: the missing glasses give off trace amounts of radiation (on account of their frames being made of radioactive material). Knowing this, we will be able to track the radiation — allowing us to finally pinpoint their exact location!"
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_18/64
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "With any luck, we’ll have them before I re-enter Earth’s thermosphere!"
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_19/11
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "I hope this message finds you well."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_19/16
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "As your CEO, David Most, I feel it is important to keep you informed about the ongoing situation regarding the stolen glasses."
msgstr ""

#. Morceau de phrase coupé par une variable (nom du joueur, nombre...).
#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_19/21
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "After thorough investigation and data collation, we have successfully tracked the glasses' radioactive signature to"
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_19/31
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "We are now in the final stages of the investigation, and it is only a matter of time before the perpetrator is apprehended. Before we take further action, I am extending one last opportunity for the individual responsible to come forward and take responsibility."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_19/36
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "I implore this individual to consider the impact on their loved ones. They’re being stubborn, and destroying the lives of everyone around them because of their stubbornness. This individual needs to realize they were wrong — say they’re sorry — and do the right thing."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_19/44
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "It is my sincere hope that they will."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_20/11
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Why are you doing this? Don’t you know I’m your CEO?! David Most?!"
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_20/16
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "You have to listen to me! And if you don’t listen to me, I’m going to fire you."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_20/21
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "That’s right: all of you!"
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_20/26
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Do you think I can’t?"
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_20/31
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "I can do that."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_20/36
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "I have the power."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_20/41
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Here look: you’re all fired!!"
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_20/46
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Call OSHA, I don’t care."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_20/51
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "I don’t even know what OSHA stands for!"
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_20/61
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Ok I’m sorry, I take that back! I don’t want to fire you — I don’t want to fire anyone!"
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_20/66
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "But listen the government says if the perpetrator doesn’t hand over the glasses voluntarily, I’m fired."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_20/71
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "I told them they couldn’t fire me, but apparently I gave them majority ownership of the company during a bender and so they totally can."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_20/76
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "So come on, please! Please just turn over the glasses!"
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_20/81
msgctxt "David Most"
msgid "Pretty please?"
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_21/4
msgctxt "Tag Appli"
msgid "Assailable"
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_21/6
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "Valdivianites,"
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_21/11
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "My name is Franklin. Franklin Oliver Ivan Lieste."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_21/16
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "As you may have surmised, I have hacked the email account of your CEO, David Most."
msgstr ""

#: wrkspace_chat/mostmail_21/21
